Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: example/xpath1.c
Line: 216
Function: print_xpath_nodes
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: When printing namespace nodes, ns->prefix is passed to fprintf with "%s" without a NULL check. For default namespaces, ns->prefix can be NULL, causing fprintf to dereference a NULL pointer. This is reachable by supplying an XPath that selects namespace nodes (e.g., /*/namespace::*).

